test errors-byte-from-int-unhandled-rejected {an unhandled byte::from_int call of a genuinely dynamic (unconstrained) value at top level is a static UNHANDLED-ERROR for both of its declared errors, one diagnostic naming both (DIAGNOSTIC-RECOVERY.md)} -body {
