test errors-byte-from-int-partial-range-elimination {a value statically known nonnegative but not upper-bounded needs only a byte::AboveRange handler/declaration -- STATIC-COMPLETION-PROOFS.md item 21} -body {
    set path [makeFile {import byte
byte::high_nibble(0)
